cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChronoReset in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ChronoReset: A Literature-Grounded Control-Policy Experiment for Aging Intervention Scheduling"
abstract: >-
  ChronoReset is a discrete-time control-policy sandbox that tests whether
  intervention *ordering* matters for a simulated patient tracked across six
  Hallmarks of Aging, subject to cross-hallmark coupling rules grounded in
  primary literature and tiered by strength of evidence. It compares greedy
  worst-first scheduling against synergy-aware lookahead, round-robin,
  fixed-priority, and random baselines.
authors:
